        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a consumer-focused, insights-driven company, we produce, market, distribute and sell a diversified portfolio of well over 400 beer and other malt beverage brands.",
        "start_character": 192,
        "end_character": 357
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our voluntary guidance labeling initiative, we continue to include smart drinking label designs on primary product packaging in countries where there is currently no mandate for legal warnings.",
        "start_character": 110258,
        "end_character": 110462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the Global Innovation and Technology Center, we also have Product, Packaging and Process development teams located in each of our geographic regions focusing on the short- and medium-term development and implementation needs of such regions.",
        "start_character": 93432,
        "end_character": 93688
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, beer and non-beer categories include not only brands that we own or license, but also third-party brands that we brew and sell, and third-party products that we sell through our distribution network.",
        "start_character": 40206,
        "end_character": 40418
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In all we do, we strive to ensure that we produce the highest-quality products, provide the best consumer experience, and maximize shareholder value by building the strongest competitive and financial position.",
        "start_character": 106553,
        "end_character": 106763
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the case of international distribution and/or importation agreements, we produce and package the products ourselves while the third party distributes, markets and sells the brands in the local market.",
        "start_character": 79672,
        "end_character": 79875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our DTC business enables deeper consumer insights and transforms how we engage with consumers, supporting category growth through the development of occasions, increased premiumization and expanded category participation.",
        "start_character": 57763,
        "end_character": 57984
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our portfolio of solutions focuses on two areas in this space which present opportunities to accelerate our growth and build on our ecosystem: our business-to-business platform, BEES, which provides e-commerce and fintech solutions to retailers and services to our wholesalers;",
        "start_character": 53990,
        "end_character": 54267
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Treasury Department oversees the industry, and each state in which we sell or produce products, and some local authorities in jurisdictions in which we sell products, also have regulations that affect the business conducted by us and other brewers and wholesalers.",
        "start_character": 94232,
        "end_character": 94496
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Using our strong distribution network, digital platforms and production facilities, we are expanding our portfolio of owned and partnership brands driving this trend.",
        "start_character": 51709,
        "end_character": 51875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088105",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We aim to develop innovative programs across our supply chain to improve our sustainability performance with our business partners.",
        "start_character": 110931,
        "end_character": 111062
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088105-7c8ff111572b3c50",
